 "text": "\nكهرباء القاهرة \nشركة الإنتاج\nالقاهرة \nWest \nمحطة توليد الكهرباء\nمحطة كهرباء غرب القاهــرة\nانقر على الروابط أدناه للوصول إلى الوثيقة المطلوبة. \nThe following 5 MPIS documents were created by the station\nغلايات\nFan-024-r0\n05/06/07\nFan-025-r0\n05/06/07\nFan-026-r0\n05/06/07\nFan-027-r0\n05/06/07\nP-144-r0\n05/06/07\n\nThe following MPIS \ndocuments can be used at the station\nPC-001-r0\nبطاقة الصيانة لتتابع الحماية \nالصفحة الخلفية\nFor All\nT-001-r1\n12/06/95\nT-004-r1\nPower \n Transformer Fuji 125MVA, M1 \n T-004-r0a\n08/07/96\nT-005-r1\nالقوة \n محول فوجي 125 ميجا فولت أمبير، Y1 \n T-005-r0a\n08/07/96\n08/07/96\n19/04/98\nT-013-r0\n19/04/98\n08/05/00\n08/05/00\n05/02/01\n05/02/01\n05/02/01\n05/02/01\n05/02/01\n05/02/01\n05/02/01\n05/02/01\n12/06/95\n23/12/96\nFS-001-r0\nTransformer Fire Pro. Sys 220kv, Total Walther, Water under Air Pressure \n W1\n15/09/97\nFS-002-r0\nTransformer Fire \n Fight. Sys 220kv, Total Walther, Water Under Air Press. Y1\n15/09/97\nCB-011-r0\nGIS CB \n 220KV, type AR2 - 300, AEG M1\n02/06/97\nCB-012-r0\nنظم المعلومات الجغرافية سي بي \n 220 كيلو فولت، نوع AR2 - 300، AEG Y1\n02/06/97\nCB-014-r0\nGIS CB \n 220kv, type FBIT, Cogelex Alsthom M1\n22/06/98\nCB-015-r0\nGIS CB 220kv, type FBIT, Cogelex Alsthom Y1\n22/06/98\nCB-019-r0\nMeasuring \n Dew point for SF6 using tester Dilo no3-053-R001/R002\n23/11/98\nBasous\nDS-002-r0\nDisconnect \n Switch 220kv, SFT105, Alsthom Cogelex, Y1\nDS-008-r0\nBahteem\nES-002-r0\nBahteem\nBahteem\nBahteem\nCT-001-r0\nالحالي \n محول 220 ك.ف.AEG.M2\nSabtia\nCT-002-r0\nCurrent \n Transformer 220KV, AEG, Y1\nAl Hadaba\nPT-001-r0\nمحول جهد 220 كيلو فولت، AEG، M2\nAl Hadaba\nPT-002-r0\nVoltage \n Transformer 220KV, AEG, Y1\nAl Hadaba\nPT-003-r0\nVoltage \n Transformer 220KV, Cogelex Alsthom France VHC-245, M1\nBasous\nBahteem\nBahteem\nB-001-r0\nAlkaline \n Battery Bank Varta Type TP-230-180 cells, W1\nBahteem\nB-002-r0\nAlkaline \n Battery Bank Varta Type TP-230-180 cells, M1\nAl Hadaba\nB-003-r0\nAlkaline \n Battery Bank Varta Type TP-230-180 cells, Y1\nBahteem\nB-007-r0\nCairo North\nB-008-r0\nCairo North\nCh-001-r0\nBattery \n Charger type TSR model 220, M3\nBasous\nCP-001-r0\nCompressor Plant type SVB - 600/250/320, W1\nEl Hadaba\nCP-002-r0\nCompressor \n Plant type SVB - 600/250/320, M1\nEl Hadaba\nCP-005-r0\nAir \n Compressor, SV2200/40, Becker Germany, W1\nHeliopolis\nCP-006-r0\nAir \n Compressor, SV2200/40, Becker Germany, M1\nHeliopolis\nCP-009-r0\nAir \n Compressor, SV2200/40, Becker Germany, M6\nAl Menia\nCP-010-r0\n\nTechnical Directive\n(TD)\nTD-SS-001-r1\nIdentify\n GIS Internal Components (2doc's) \n Arabic doc\n23/12/96\nTD-SS-005-r0\nSafety\n Guideline for Using SF6\nTD-SS-006-r0\nDew\n Point testing for SF6\n\nالنشرة الفنية \n(السل)\nTB-SS-001-r0\nPower\n Transformer Insulation Deterioration\n12/02/02\n12/02/02\n06/02/02\n08/05/00\n08/05/00\n29/12/97\n08/05/00\n",
